# `ollama show qwen3.5:9b --modelfile` on the lab Ollama (0.34.4), read on
# 2026-10-04 and recorded in docs/TRAIN-WORKSTATION.md §5. The lines export.py
# copies into the student's Modelfile (TEMPLATE, RENDERER, PARSER, PARAMETER);
# the FROM blob paths and the LICENSE block are dropped by the export anyway and
# are left out here. Use it as `export.py --base-modelfile` wherever no Ollama
# runs (the training VM, docs/TRAIN-REMOTE.md) — never point OLLAMA_HOST at the
# busy lab server for this. Re-read the lines when the base tag is re-pulled.
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
RENDERER qwen3.5
PARSER qwen3.5
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
